Chromium 159.0.8154.45 + the later changes of its release branch, up to
fc4c7c309a0a5d466a982bddd133bcb23a983614 (refs/branch-heads/8154@{#1541}), for the
159.0.8154.45 tree (the chromium-159.0.8154.28-lite.tar.xz tarball, upgrade patches:
chromium-159.0.8154.28-to-159.0.8154.45.patch). The newest change it carries is
8154@{#1541}.

Generated from the upstream diffs chromium/src refs/tags/159.0.8154.45..fc4c7c309a0a and the
dependency whose DEPS revision changed: ANGLE 4dd34493f8a2..9cb758f56d71 (under
third_party/angle/), as served by Gitiles, with scripts/chromium-delta/branch-fixes.py
(filter.py --branch-fixes, against the 159.0.8154.45 tree's files): left out are files not
in the release tarball, iOS/Android/ChromeOS/Mac/Windows-only files, tests and docs (GN
files kept), translations other than en-GB, PGO/orderfile/AFDO pointers, submodule pointer
updates. chrome/VERSION (the branch's "Incrementing VERSION" commits after the 159.0.8154.45
tag are not tags yet), the DEPS files and the stamp files stay at 159.0.8154.45.

Commits contributing to it (oldest first):
  e8dd7df98b89 Roll commits from side projects in M159 (ANGLE 4dd34493f8a2..9cb758f56d71, 8154@{#1538})
  f99b2eb99572 [M159] Support circle highlight engaged indicator style in WebUI toolbar. (8154@{#1539})
  630964377970 [M159] WebUI: Follow up refinements to WebUIExtension (8154@{#1540})
  fc4c7c309a0a [M159] [contextual-tasks] Fix site settings crash on permission chips (8154@{#1541})
Dependency commits of those rolls that touch kept files:
  315c40454305 [M159] Vulkan: Don't reformat image to new base level's format (ANGLE: src/libANGLE/renderer/vulkan/TextureVk.cpp)
  9cb758f56d71 [M159] Vulkan: Derive texture usage flags from the image's format (ANGLE: src/libANGLE/renderer/vulkan/TextureVk.cpp, src/libANGLE/renderer/vulkan/TextureVk.h)

